  noteTitle: "HAVELI KEEPER'S DIARY \u2014 FLOOR I"
  noteBody: "The bandits drag travelers into this Forgotten Haveli, where only an antique oil lamp stands against the pitch dark.\n\nFour carved Puzzle Pieces are hidden inside the wardrobes, apothecary chests, and desks of this floor. Bring all 4 pieces to the locked Treasure Chest in the north hall to claim the Exit Key.\n\nOil drains fast and caps at 100% \u2014 search every drawer carefully!"
